        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it just me, or is the sky getting darker?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...If only it was just you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "We never had much time anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_9_2",
        "x": 50,
        "y": 30,
        "xScale": 1.15,
        "yScale": 1.15,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": 50,
        "yFrom": 20,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 0,
        "xScaleFrom": 1.15,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.15,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 15,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The shape of the Catastrophe cloud is more clearly defined than the black haze it was before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk. I don't like the feeling I get from watching it form over our heads. What a bad omen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "To make things worse, Reunion goons might be lurking in every nook and cranny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, that's probably too conservative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What you should've said is that they're probably partying on the streets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Almost every street is filled with destruction, violence and looting. Vehicles and buildings are being set on fire...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "But these thugs decide that it's the perfect weather for a picnic!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they're going out on a picnic now, it's the Catastrophe that will feast upon their bones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "This proves that most Reunion members are just fools who've been whipped into a frenzy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Pfft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, they're not really having a picnic...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, I just wanted something to moan about. You didn't have to take me so seriously...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you weren't being serious\uff1fWait, were you trying to crack a joke?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I'm not good with this stuff...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Umm... It's fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that... trying not to laugh is hard...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, sorry... for trying to make a joke at such a serious time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island wasn't founded for the sake of having everyone keep a serious face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always wanted everyone to be able to smile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A-Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In any case, let's help out with the scouting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll quietly dispatch the enemy at our four o'clock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hopefully their diseased organs won't explode or be rigged to serve as some kind of alarm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll wrap around and take care of the large group on the other side of the fortification.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "With this much chaos around us, nobody will notice a little more noise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, let's move out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
